OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for scamming friends
OL,4,Aout of #151,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who scammed a group of friends
OL,7,Fout of more than #151,000 has been
OL,8,Fjailed for four years.
OL,10,FJemma Davidson, 42, of Morpeth
OL,11,FCrescent, Houghton Regis, Bedfordshire,
OL,12,Fclaimed she was due a large insurance
OL,13,Fpayout and promised to repay the money,
OL,14,Fbut it never materialised.
OL,16,FHertfordshire Police said Davidson
OL,17,Fproduced fake emails and letters to
OL,18,Fspin "an elaborate web of lies".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
