OL,3,GNEWSAWoman jailed for scamming friends
OL,4,Aout of #151,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was sentenced at Luton Crown Court
OL,7,Fon 25 September after pleading guilty
OL,8,Fto fraud by false representation and
OL,9,Fforgery at an earlier hearing.
